===License plate graphics===
{{Expand section|date=August 2022}}
Plates with graphics are also available.<ref>{{cite web |title=Choose a licence plate graphic |url=https://www.ontario.ca/page/choose-licence-plate-graphic |website=Service Ontario |publisher=Ontario Government |access-date=9 August 2022}}</ref> Graphics first being issued on license plates began in 1996. The variety of graphics includes charities, universities, community organizations and popular Ontario sports teams, such as the [[Ottawa Senators]]. All plates offer the French slogan since 2017.<ref name="EricPlate" />
