File:Defective Ontario Plate Front.jpg|Close-up view of early damage to a front licence plate of an Ontario car. The reflective layer can be seen de-laminating and separating from the metal base.
File:Defective Ontario Plate Rear.jpg|Close-up view of similar damage to the rear plate of the same car, indicating this problem is not confined to the front plates. 
